# ── Legacy R2 (attribution patterns) — false positives ──────────────────────
# scripts/tagging-worker.mjs talks to LM Studio (a local inference tool).
# The phrase "load the model in LM Studio" refers to LM Studio's model
# concept, not to attribution of automated authorship.
R2: scripts/tagging-worker.mjs

# scripts/seed-webgames.mjs has a description field describing a website
# that catalogues content produced by automation. The seeder is describing
# the source material, not claiming it as such.
R2: scripts/seed-webgames.mjs

